    {
     "type": "heading",
     "level": 1,
     "text": "Commercial sauna and spa interior design, 120 m²"
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "parts": [
      {
       "t": "p",
       "html": "<strong>DUMSKAYA DESIGN (Bratislava, Slovakia)</strong> developed an interior design project for a 120 m² commercial sauna and spa. The interior concept combines functional planning, guest comfort, and a contemporary aesthetic for a space dedicated to relaxation and wellness treatments."
      },
      {
       "t": "p",
       "html": "The project included an overall style concept, layout solutions, and functional zoning. The space includes a reception area, a changing room with showers, restrooms, a lounge area, shared circulation areas, and a massage room. The layout is organized to ensure a logical visitor flow and convenient operation of the commercial facility."
      },
      {
       "t": "p",
       "html": "Special attention was paid to the atmosphere of the interior, ergonomics, and the way the different functional areas work together. Custom furniture was also designed for the premises, matching the overall concept and making efficient use of the available space."
      },
      {
       "t": "p",
       "html": "The client can use the interior design project to carry out the work independently, or it can serve as the basis for full project delivery by <strong>DUMSKAYA DESIGN</strong> specialists. Depending on the task, the range of services can include design supervision, turnkey renovation, and the design and manufacture of custom furniture."
      },
      {
       "t": "p",
       "html": "<strong>DUMSKAYA DESIGN</strong> offers interior design for saunas, steam baths, spas, and wellness spaces in Bratislava and Vienna. We design commercial interiors that take into account the specifics of the business, technical requirements, visitor comfort, and efficient use of floor area — from concept and design documentation to custom furniture and full project delivery."
      }
     ]
    },
